cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the version you used."
type: software
title: "Causal Uplift Modelling and Campaign Decision Economics: A Reproducible Python Framework"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python framework for heterogeneous treatment effect
  estimation, honest uplift evaluation, and cost-aware marketing campaign
  targeting. Includes S-, T-, X-, and doubly robust learners, Qini and AUUC
  evaluation, bootstrap uncertainty, economic optimization, and guided notebooks.
